- Designed a dark, editorial visual identity for the site. Cormorant Garamond serif headlines are paired with DM Sans body text and gold accents to signal prestige.
- Built a cinematic hero over a city backdrop, with the date, location and two clear calls to action: “Secure Your Seat” and “Explore Agenda”.
- Structured the story across Home, About, Agenda, FAQ, Contact and Register pages, so each visitor question has a clear answer.
- Added a headline stats band (attendees, speakers, event scale) to build credibility quickly.
- Built a tabbed agenda for the multi-session programme, with session types tagged (Keynote, Panel, Masterclass, Fireside).
- Built a free registration form (name, email, phone, organisation), with registration CTAs repeated throughout the site.
- Made the full layout responsive for mobile, tablet and desktop.
